  "ja542:0.4": "9. ummaggajātakaṃ ",
  "ja542:1.1": "sabbasaṃhārako natthi suddhaṃ kaṅgu pavāyati, alikaṃ bhāsatayaṃ dhuttī saccamāhu mahallikā. sattadārakapañhā. haṃsi tuvaṃ evaṃ maññesi seyyo puttena pitāti rājaseṭṭha, handassatarassa te ayaṃ assatarassa hi gadrabho pitā. gadrabhapañho. ekūnavīsatipañhā niṭṭhitā. nāyaṃ pure unnamati toraṇagge kakaṇṭako, mahosadha vijānāhi kena thaddho kakaṇṭako. aladdhapubbaṃ laddhāna addhamāsaṃ kakaṇṭako, atimaññati rājānaṃ vedehaṃ mithilaggahaṃ. kakaṇṭaka pañho. itthi siyā rūpavatī sā ca sīlavatī siyā puriso taṃ na iccheyya saddahāsi mahosadha. saddahāmi mahārāja puriso dubbhago siyā, sirī ca kālakaṇṇi ca na samonti kudācanaṃ. sirikālakaṇṇi pañho. yesaṃ na kadāci bhūtapubbaṃ sakkhiṃ sattapadampi imasmiṃ leke, jātā amittā duve sahāyā paṭisandhāya caranti kissa hetu. yadi me ajja pātarāsakāle pañhaṃ na sakkuṇeyyātha vattumetaṃ, raṭṭhā pabbājayissāmi vo sabbe na hi mattho duppaññajātikehi. mahājanasamāgamambhi ghore janakolahalasamāgamambhi jāte, vikkhittamanā anekacittā pañhaṃ na sakkuṇoma vattumetaṃ. ekaggacittā ekamekā rahasīgatā atthaṃ nicintayitvā, paviveke sammasitvāna dhīrā atha vakkhanti janinda atthametaṃ. uggaputtarājaputtiyāna urabbhamaṃsaṃ piyaṃ manāpaṃ, na te sunakhassa adenti maṃsaṃ atha meṇḍassa suṇena sabyamassa. cammaṃ vihananti eḷakassa assapiṭṭhattharaṇasukhassa hetu, na te sunakhassa attharatti atha meṇḍassa suṇena sabyamassa. āvellitasiṅgiko hi meṇḍo na sunakhassa visāṇāni atthi, tiṇabhakkho maṃsabhojano ca atha meṇḍassa suṇena sabyamassa. tiṇamāsi pālasamāsi meṇḍo na sunakho tiṇamāsi no palāsaṃ, gaṇheyya suṇo sasaṃ biḷāraṃ atha meṇḍassa suṇena sabyamassa. aḍḍhaṭṭhapādo catuppadassa meṇḍo aṭṭhanakho adissamāno, chādiyaṃ āharati ayaṃ imassa maṃsaṃ āharati ayaṃ amussa. pāsādagato videhaseṭṭho vītihāraṃ aññamaññabhojanānaṃ, addakkhi kira sakkhi taṃ janindo bhobhukkassa ca puṇṇamukhassa cetaṃ. lābhā vata me anapparūpā yassa me edisā paṇḍitā kulambhi, gambhīragataṃ nipuṇamatthaṃ paṭivijjhanti subhāsitena dhīrā. assatarīrathañca ekamekaṃ phītaṃ gāmavarañca ekamekaṃ, sabbaṃ vo dammi paṇḍitānaṃ paramappatītamano subhāsitenāti. (dvādasanipāte) meṇḍakapañhaṃ. paññāyupetaṃ siriyā vihīnaṃ yasassinañcāpi apetapaññaṃ, pucchāmi taṃ senaka etamatthaṃ kamettha seyyo kusalā vadanti. dhīrā ca bālā ca bhatva janinda sippūpapannā ca asippino ca, sujātimantopi ajātimassa yasassino pessakarā bhavanti: etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi pañño nihīno sirimāva seyyo. tavampi pucchāmi anomapañña mahosadha kevaladhammadassi, bālaṃ yasassiṃ paṇḍitaṃ appabhogaṃ kamettha seyyo kusalā vadanti. pāpāni kammāni karoti bālo idhameva seyyo iti maññamāno, idhalokadassi paralokaṃ adassī ubhayattha bālo kalimaggahesi; etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi paññova seyyo na yasassī bālo. na sippametaṃ vidadhāti bhogaṃ na bandhavā na sarīrāvakāso passeḷamūgaṃ sukhamedhamānaṃ, sirī hi naṃ bhajate gorimanadaṃ etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi pañño nihīno sirimāva seyyo. laddhā sukhaṃ majjati appapañño dukkhena phuṭṭhopi pamohameti āgantunā sukhadukkhena phuṭṭho pavedhati vāricarova ghamme etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññeva seyyo na yasassī bālo. dūmaṃ yathā sāduphalaṃ araññe samantato samabhicaranti pakkhī, evampi aḍḍhaṃ sadhanaṃ sabhogaṃ bahujjano bhajati atthahetu; etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. pañño nihīno sirimāva seyyo. na sādhu balavā bālo sāhasaṃ vindate dhanaṃ, kandantameva dummedhaṃ kaḍḍhanti niraye bhusaṃ. etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññova seyyo na yasassī bālo. yā kāci najjo gaṅgamabhissavanti sabbāva tā nāmagottaṃ jahanti gaṅgā samuddaṃ paṭipajjamānā na khāyate iddhiparo hi loko etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññeva nihīno sirimāva seyyo. yametamakkhā udadhiṃ mahantaṃ savanti najjo sabbakālaṃ asaṅkhaṃ so sāgaro niccamuḷāravego velaṃ na acceti mahāsamuddo. evampi bālassa pajappitāni paññaṃ na acceti sirī kadāci etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññova seyyo na yasassī bālo. asaññato cepi paresamatthaṃ bhaṇāti santhānagato yasassi tasseva taṃ rūhati ñātimajjhe siri hi naṃ kārayate na paññā, etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. pañño nihīno sirimāva seyyo. parassa vā attano vāpi hetu bālo musā bhāsati appapañño so nindito hoti sabhāya majjhe peccāpi so duggatigāmi hoti. etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññeva seyyo na yasassī bālo. atthampi ce bhāsati bhūripañño anāḷhiyo appadhano daḷiddo na tassa taṃ rūti ñātimajjhe sirī ca paññāṇavato na hoti, etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. pañño nihīno sirimāva seyyo. parassa vā attano vāpi hetu na bhāsati alikaṃ bhūripañño so pūjito hoti sahāya majjhe peccañca so suggatigāmi hoti etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññova seyyo na yasassī bālo. hatthigavassā maṇikuṇḍalā ca nāriyo ca iddhesu kulesu jātā sabbāva tā upabhogā bhavanti; iddhassa posassa aniddhimanto etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññeva seyyo na yasassī bālo. asaṃvihitakammantaṃ bālaṃ dummantamantinaṃ, sirī jahati dummedhaṃ jiṇṇaṃva urago tacaṃ, etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññova seyyo na yasassī bālo. pañca paṇḍitā mayaṃ bhadante sabbe pañjalikā upaṭṭhitā tvaṃ no abhibhuyya issarosi sakko bhūtapatīva devarājā etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. pañño nihīno sirimāva seyyo. dāsova paññassa yasassi bālo atthesu jātesu tathāvidhesu, yaṃ paṇḍito nipuṇaṃ saṃcidheti sammohamāpajjati tattha balo etampi disvāna ahaṃ vadāmi. paññova seyyo na yasassi bālo. addhā hi paññāva sataṃ pasatthā kantā sirī bhogaratā manussā, ñāṇañca buddhānamatulyarūpaṃ paññaṃ na acceti sirī kadāci. yaṃ taṃ apucchimha akittayī no mahosadha kevaladhammadassī gavaṃ sahassaṃ usabhañca nāgaṃ; ājaññayutte ca rathe dasa ime pañhassa veyyākaraṇena tuṭṭho dadāmi te gāmavarāni soḷasa. vīsatinipāte sirimanda pañho. yena sattubilaṅgā ca dvīguṇapalāso ca pupphito, yenādāmi tena vadāmi, yena nādāmi na tena vadāmi, esa maggo yavamajjhakassa etaṃ channapathaṃ vijānahi. channapathapañho hanti hatthehi pādehi mukhañca parisumbhati, sace rāja piyo hoti kaṃ tenamabhipassati. ko nu santamhi pajjote aggipariyesanaṃ caraṃ, addakkhi rattiṃ khajjota jātavedaṃ amaññatha. svāssa gomayacuṇṇāni abhimatthaṃ tiṇāni ca, viparītāya saññāya nāsakkhi sañajaletave. evampi anupāyena atthaṃ na labhate mago, visāṇato gavaṃ dohaṃ yattha khīraṃ na vindati. vividhehi upāyehi atthaṃ papponti māṇavā, niggahena amittānaṃ mittānaṃ paggahena ca. seṇimokkhopalābhena vallabhānaṃ nayena ca, jagatiṃ jagatīpālā avasanti vasundharaṃ. khajjopaṇaka pañho. sacca kira tvampi bhūripañño yā tādisī siri dhitī mutī ca, na tāyate bhāvavasūpanītaṃ yo yāvakaṃ bhuñjasi appasūpaṃ. sukhaṃ dukkhena paripācayanto kālakālaṃ vicinaṃ chandachanno, atthassa dvārāni avāpuranto tenāhaṃ tussāmi yavodanena. kālañca ñatvā abhijīhanāya mantehi atthaṃ paripācayitvā, vijambhissaṃ sīhavijamhitāni tāyiddhiyā dakkhasi maṃ punāpi. sukhī hi eke karonti pāpaṃ avaṇṇasaṃsaggabhayā puneke, pahū samāno vipulatthicinti kiṃ kāraṇā me na karosi dukkhaṃ. na paṇḍitā antasukhassa hetu pāpāni kammāni samācaranti, dukkhena puṭṭhā khalitattāpi santā chandā ca dosā na jahanti dhammaṃ. yena kenaci vaṇṇena mudunā dārunena vā, uddhare dīnamattānaṃ pacchā dhammaṃ samācare. yassa rukkhassa chāyāya nisīdeyya sayeyya vā, na tassa sākhaṃ bhañjeyya mittadubbho hi pāpako. yassā hi dhammaṃ manujo vijaññā yecassa kaṅkhaṃ vinayanti santo, taṃ hissa dīpañca parāyaṇañca na tena mittaṃ jarayetha pañño. alaso gihī kāmabhogī na sādhu asaññato pabbajito na sādhu, rājā na sādhu anisammakārī yo paṇḍito kodhano taṃ na sādhu. nisamma khattiyo kayirā nānisamma disampati, nisammakārino rāja yaso kitti ca vaḍḍhati. bhūripañho. hanti hatthehi pādehi mukhañca parisumbhati, sa ce rāja piyo hoti kaṃ tena mabhipassasi. akkosati yathākāmaṃ āgamañcassa na icchati, sa ce rājā piyo hoti taṃ tena mabhipassasi. abbhakkhāti abhūtena alikena mabhisāraye, sa ce rāja piyo hoti kaṃ tena mabhipassasi. haraṃ annañca pānañca vatthasenāsanāni ca, aññadatthu harā santā te ve rāja piyā honti kaṃ tenamabhipassasi. devatāpucchita pañhā. pañca paṇḍitā samāgatā pañho me paṭibhāti taṃ suṇātha, nindiyamatthaṃ pasaṃsiyaṃ vā kassevāvikareyya guyhamatthaṃ. tvaṃ no āvikarohi bhūmipāla bhattā bhārasaho tuvaṃ vadetaṃ, tava chandañca ruciñca sammasitvā atha vakkhanti janinda pañca dhīrā. yā sīlavatī anaññadheyyā bhattucchandavasānugā piyā manāpā, nindiyamatthaṃ pasaṃsiyaṃ vā bhariyāyāvikareyya guyhamatthaṃ. yo kicchagatassa āturassa saraṇaṃ hoti gatī parāyaṇañca, nindiyamatthaṃ pasaṃsiyaṃ vā sakhinovāvikareyya guyhamatthaṃ. jeṭṭho atha majjhimo kaṇiṭṭho so ce sīlasamāhito ṭhitatto, nindiyamatthaṃ pasaṃsiyaṃ vā bhātuvāvikareyya guyhamatthaṃ. yo ce pituhadayassa paddhagu anujāto pitaraṃ anomapañño, nindiyamatthaṃ pasaṃsiyaṃ vā puttassāvīkareyya guyhamatthaṃ. mātā dipadā janindaseṭṭha yo taṃ poseti chandasā piyena, nindiyamatthaṃ pasaṃsiyaṃ vā mātuyāvikareyya guyhamatthaṃ. guyhassa hi guyhameva sādhu na hi guyhassa pasatthamāvikammaṃ, anipphādāya saheyya dhīro nipphannattho yathāsukhaṃ bhaṇeyya. kinnu tvaṃ vimano rājaseṭṭha dipadinda vacanaṃ suṇoma netaṃ, kiṃ cintayamāno dummanosi nūna deva aparādho atthi mayhaṃ. pañño vajjho mahosadhoti āṇatto me vadhāya bhūripañño, taṃ cintayanto dummanosmi na hi devi aparādho atthi tuyhaṃ. abhidosagato idāni esi kiṃ sutvā kimāsaṃkate mano te, ko te kimavoca bhūripañña iṅgha taṃ vacanaṃ suṇoma brūhi metaṃ. pañño vajjho mahosadhoti yadi te mantayitaṃ janinda dosaṃ, bhariyāya rahogato asaṃsi guyhaṃ pātukataṃ sutaṃ mametaṃ. yaṃ sālavanasmiṃ senako pāpakammaṃ akāsi asabbhirūpaṃ, sakhinova rahogato asaṃsi guyhaṃ pātukataṃ sutaṃ mametaṃ. pukkusapurisassa te janinda uppanno rogo arājayutto, bhātucca rahogato asaṃsi guyhaṃ pātukataṃ sutaṃ mametaṃ. ābādhoyaṃ asabbhirūpo kāvindo naradevena phuṭṭho, puttassa rahogato asaṃsi guyhaṃ pātukataṃ sutaṃ mametaṃ. aṭṭhavaṅkaṃ maṇiratanaṃ uḷāraṃ sakko te adadā pitāmahassa, devindassa gataṃ tadajja hatthaṃ mātucca rahogato asaṃsi guyhaṃ pātukataṃ sutaṃ mametaṃ. guyhassa hi guyhameva sādhu na hi guyhassa pasatthamāvikammaṃ, anipphādāya saheyya dhīro nipphannattho yathāsukhaṃ bhaṇeyya. na guyhamatthaṃ vivareyya rakkheyya naṃ yathā nidhiṃ, na hi pātukato sādhu guyho attho pajānatā. thiyā guyhaṃ na saṃseyya amittassa ca paṇḍito, yo cāmisena saṃhīro hadayattheno ca yo naro. guyhamatthamasambuddhaṃ sambodhayati yo naro, mantabhedabhayā tassa dasabhūto titikkhati. yāvanto purisassatthaṃ guyhaṃ jānanti mantinaṃ, tāvanto tassa ubbegā tasmā guyhaṃ na vissaje. vivicca bhāseyya divā rahassaṃ rattiṃ giraṃ nātivela pamuñce, upassutikā hi suṇanti mantaṃ tasmā manto khippamupeti bhedaṃ. vīsatinipāte pañcapaṇḍitapañho. pañcālo sabbasenāya ",
  "ja542:1.2": "brahmadatto samāgato, ",
  "ja542:1.3": "sāyaṃ pañcāliyā senā ",
  "ja542:1.4": "appameyyā mahosadha. ",
  "ja542:2.1": "piṭṭhimatī pattimatī ",
  "ja542:2.2": "sabbasaṅgāmakovidā, ",
  "ja542:2.3": "ohārinī saddavatī ",
  "ja542:2.4": "bherisaṅkhappabodhanā. ",
  "ja542:3.1": "lohavijjālaṅkārābhā ",
  "ja542:3.2": "dhajinī vāmarohiṇī ",
  "ja542:3.3": "sippiyehi susampannā ",
  "ja542:3.4": "sūrehi suppatiṭṭhitā. ",
  "ja542:4.1": "dasettha paṇḍitā āhu ",
  "ja542:4.2": "bhūripaññā rahogamā, ",
  "ja542:4.3": "mātā ekādasī rañño ",
  "ja542:4.4": "pañcāliyaṃ pasāsati. ",
  "ja542:5.1": "athetthekasataṃ khatyā ",
  "ja542:5.2": "anuyuttā yasassino, ",
  "ja542:5.3": "acchinnaraṭṭhā byathitā ",
  "ja542:5.4": "pañcālīnaṃ vasaṃgatā. ",
  "ja542:6.1": "yaṃvadā takkarā rañño ",
  "ja542:6.2": "akāmā piyabhāṇino, ",
  "ja542:6.3": "pañcālamanuyāyanti ",
  "ja542:6.4": "akāmā vasino gatā. ",
  "ja542:7.1": "tāya senāya mithilā ",
  "ja542:7.2": "tisandhi parivāritā, ",
  "ja542:7.3": "rājadhāni videhānaṃ ",
  "ja542:7.4": "samantā parikhaññati. ",
  "ja542:8.1": "uddhaṃ tārakajātāva ",
  "ja542:8.2": "samantā parivāritā, ",
  "ja542:8.3": "mahosadha vijānāhi ",
  "ja542:8.4": "kathaṃ mokkho bhavissati. ",
  "ja542:9.1": "pāde deva pasārehi ",
  "ja542:9.2": "bhuñja kāme ramassu ca, ",
  "ja542:9.3": "hitvā pañcāliyaṃ senā ",
  "ja542:9.4": "brahmadatto palāyati. ",
  "ja542:10.1": "rājā santhavakāmo te ",
  "ja542:10.2": "ratanāni pavecchati, ",
  "ja542:10.3": "āgacchantu tato dūtā ",
  "ja542:10.4": "mañjukā piyabhāṇino. ",
  "ja542:11.1": "bhāsantu mudukā vācā ",
  "ja542:11.2": "yā vācā paṭinanditā, ",
  "ja542:11.3": "pañcālā ca videhā ca ",
  "ja542:11.4": "uho ekā bhavantu te. ",
  "ja542:12.1": "kathannu kevaṭṭa mahosadhena ",
  "ja542:12.2": "samāgamo āsi tadiṅgha brūhi ",
  "ja542:12.3": "kacci te paṭinijjhanto ",
  "ja542:12.4": "kacci tuṭṭho mahosadho. ",
  "ja542:13.1": "anariyarūpo puriso janinda, ",
  "ja542:13.2": "asammodako thaddho asabbhirūpo ",
  "ja542:13.3": "yathā mūgo ca badhiro ca ",
  "ja542:13.4": "na kiñcatthaṃ abhāsatha. ",
  "ja542:14.1": "addhā idaṃ mantapadaṃ sududdasaṃ ",
  "ja542:14.2": "attho suddho naraviriyena diṭṭho, ",
  "ja542:14.3": "tathā hi kāyo mama sampavedhati ",
  "ja542:14.4": "hitvā sayaṃ ko parahatthamessati. ",
  "ja542:15.1": "channaṃ hi ekāva matī sameti ",
  "ja542:15.2": "ye paṇḍitā uttamabhūripattā, ",
  "ja542:15.3": "yānaṃ ayānaṃ athavāpi ṭhānaṃ ",
  "ja542:15.4": "mahosadha tvampi matiṃ karohi. ",
  "ja542:16.1": "jānāsi kho rāja mahānubhāvo ",
  "ja542:16.2": "mahabbalo cūḷanibrahmadatto ",
  "ja542:16.3": "rājā ca taṃ icchati kāraṇatthaṃ ",
  "ja542:16.4": "migaṃ yathā okacarena luddo. ",
  "ja542:17.1": "yathāpi maccho baḷisaṃ ",
  "ja542:17.2": "vaṅkaṃ maṃsena chāditaṃ, ",
  "ja542:17.3": "āmagiddho na jānāti ",
  "ja542:17.4": "maccho maraṇamattano. ",
  "ja542:18.1": "evameva tuvaṃ rāja ",
  "ja542:18.2": "cūḷanīyassa dhītaraṃ, ",
  "ja542:18.3": "kāmagiddho na jānāsi ",
  "ja542:18.4": "macchova maraṇamattano. ",
  "ja542:19.1": "sace gacchasi pañcālaṃ ",
  "ja542:19.2": "khippamattaṃ jahissasi, ",
  "ja542:19.3": "migaṃ pathānupannaṃva ",
  "ja542:19.4": "mahantaṃ bhayamessati. ",
  "ja542:20.1": "mayameva bālamhase eḷamūgā ",
  "ja542:20.2": "ye uttamatthāni tayī lapimbha, ",
  "ja542:20.3": "kimeva tvaṃ naṅgalakoṭivaddho ",
  "ja542:20.4": "atthāni jānāsi yathāpi aññe. ",
  "ja542:21.1": "imaṃ gale gahetvāna ",
  "ja542:21.2": "nāsetha vijitā mama, ",
  "ja542:21.3": "yo me ratanalābhassa ",
  "ja542:21.4": "antarāyāya bhāsati. ",
  "ja542:22.1": "tato ca so apakkamma ",
  "ja542:22.2": "vedehassa upantikā, ",
  "ja542:22.3": "atha āmantayī dūtaṃ ",
  "ja542:22.4": "māḍharaṃ suvapaṇḍitaṃ. ",
  "ja542:23.1": "ehi samma harīpakkha ",
  "ja542:23.2": "veyyāvaccaṃ karohi me, ",
  "ja542:23.3": "atthi pañcālarājassa ",
  "ja542:23.4": "sāḷikā sayanapālikā. ",
  "ja542:24.1": "taṃ pattharena pucchassu ",
  "ja542:24.2": "sā hi sabbassa kovidā, ",
  "ja542:24.3": "sā tesaṃ sabbaṃ jānāti ",
  "ja542:24.4": "rañño ca kosiyassa ca. ",
  "ja542:25.1": "āmoti so paṭissutvā ",
  "ja542:25.2": "māḍharo suvapaṇḍito, ",
  "ja542:25.3": "agamāsi harīpakkho ",
  "ja542:25.4": "sāḷikāya upantikaṃ. ",
  "ja542:26.1": "tato, ca kho so gantvāna ",
  "ja542:26.2": "māḍharo suvapaṇḍito, ",
  "ja542:26.3": "atha āmantayī sugharaṃ ",
  "ja542:26.4": "sāḷikaṃ mañjubhāṇikaṃ. ",
  "ja542:27.1": "kacci te sughare khamanīyaṃ ",
  "ja542:27.2": "kacci vesse anāmayaṃ, ",
  "ja542:27.3": "kacci te madhunā lājā ",
  "ja542:27.4": "labbhate sughare tava. ",
  "ja542:28.1": "kusalañceva me samma ",
  "ja542:28.2": "atho samma anāmayaṃ, ",
  "ja542:28.3": "atho me madhunā lājā ",
  "ja542:28.4": "labbhate suvapaṇḍita. ",
  "ja542:29.1": "kuto nu samma āgamma ",
  "ja542:29.2": "kassa vā pahito tuvaṃ, ",
  "ja542:29.3": "na ca mesi ito pubbe ",
  "ja542:29.4": "diṭṭho vā yadi vā suto. ",
  "ja542:30.1": "ahosiṃ sivirājassa ",
  "ja542:30.2": "pāsādo sayanapālako, ",
  "ja542:30.3": "tato so dhammiko rājā ",
  "ja542:30.4": "baddhe mocesi bandhanā. ",
  "ja542:31.1": "tassa mekā dutiyāsi ",
  "ja542:31.2": "sāḷikā mañjubhāṇikā, ",
  "ja542:31.3": "taṃ tattha avadhī seno ",
  "ja542:31.4": "pekkhato sughare mama. ",
  "ja542:32.1": "tassā kāmā hi sammatto ",
  "ja542:32.2": "āgatosmi tavantike, ",
  "ja542:32.3": "sace kareyyāsi okāsaṃ ",
  "ja542:32.4": "ubhayova vasāmase. ",
  "ja542:33.1": "suvova suviṃ kāmeyya ",
  "ja542:33.2": "sāḷiko pana sāḷikaṃ, ",
  "ja542:33.3": "suvassa sāḷikāya ca ",
  "ja542:33.4": "saṃvāso hoti kīdiso. ",
  "ja542:34.1": "yaṃ yaṃ kāmī kāmayati ",
  "ja542:34.2": "api caṇḍālikāmapi, ",
  "ja542:34.3": "sabbehi sadiso hoti ",
  "ja542:34.4": "natthi kāme asādiso. ",
  "ja542:35.1": "atthi jambāvatī nāma ",
  "ja542:35.2": "mātā sivissa rājino, ",
  "ja542:35.3": "sā bhariyā vāsudevassa ",
  "ja542:35.4": "kaṇhassa mahesī piyā. ",
  "ja542:36.1": "rathāvatī kimpurisī ",
  "ja542:36.2": "sāpi vacchaṃ akāmayi, ",
  "ja542:36.3": "manusso migiyā saddhiṃ ",
  "ja542:36.4": "natthi kāme asādiso. ",
  "ja542:37.1": "handa khohaṃ gamissāmi ",
  "ja542:37.2": "sāḷike maṃjubhāṇike, paccakkhānupadaṃ ",
  "ja542:37.3": "hetaṃ ",
  "ja542:37.4": "atimaññasi nūna maṃ. ",
  "ja542:38.1": "na sirī taramānassa ",
  "ja542:38.2": "māḍhara suvapaṇḍita, ",
  "ja542:38.3": "idheva tāva acchassu ",
  "ja542:38.4": "yāva rājānaṃ dakkhasi, ",
  "ja542:38.5": "sossasi saddaṃ mutiṅgānaṃ ",
  "ja542:38.6": "ānubhāvañca rājino. ",
  "ja542:39.1": "yo nu khoyaṃ tibbo saddo ",
  "ja542:39.2": "tirojanapade suto, ",
  "ja542:39.3": "dhītā pañcālarājassa ",
  "ja542:39.4": "osadhī viya vaṇṇinī; ",
  "ja542:39.5": "taṃ dassati videhānaṃ ",
  "ja542:39.6": "so vivāho bhavissati. ",
  "ja542:40.1": "nediso te amittānaṃ ",
  "ja542:40.2": "vivāho hotu māḍhara, ",
  "ja542:40.3": "yathā pañcālarājassa ",
  "ja542:40.4": "vedehena bhavissati. ",
  "ja542:41.1": "ānayitvāna vedehaṃ ",
  "ja542:41.2": "pañcālānaṃ rathesabho, ",
  "ja542:41.3": "tato naṃ ghātayissati ",
  "ja542:41.4": "nāssa sakkhi bhavissati. ",
  "ja542:42.1": "handa kho maṃ anujānāhi ",
  "ja542:42.2": "rattiyo sattamattiyo, ",
  "ja542:42.3": "yāvāhaṃ sivirājassa ",
  "ja542:42.4": "ārocemi mahesino, ",
  "ja542:42.5": "laddho ca me āvasatho ",
  "ja542:42.6": "sāḷikāya upantikaṃ. ",
  "ja542:43.1": "handa kho taṃ anujānāmi ",
  "ja542:43.2": "rattiyo sattamattiyo, ",
  "ja542:43.3": "sace tvaṃ sattarattena ",
  "ja542:43.4": "nāgacchasi mamantike; ",
  "ja542:43.5": "maññe okkantasattaṃ maṃ ",
  "ja542:43.6": "matāya āgamissasi. ",
  "ja542:44.1": "tato ca kho so gantvāna ",
  "ja542:44.2": "māḍharo suvapaṇḍito, ",
  "ja542:44.3": "mahosadhassa akkhāsi ",
  "ja542:44.4": "sāḷiyā vacanaṃ idaṃ. ",
  "ja542:45.1": "yasseva ghare bhuñjeyya bhogaṃ, ",
  "ja542:45.2": "tasseva atthaṃ puriso careyya. ",
  "ja542:45.3": "handāhaṃ gacchāmi pure janinda, ",
  "ja542:45.4": "pañcālarājassa puraṃ surammaṃ; ",
  "ja542:45.5": "nivesanāni māpetuṃ ",
  "ja542:45.6": "vedehassa yasassino. ",
  "ja542:46.1": "nivesanāni māpetvā ",
  "ja542:46.2": "vedehassa yasassino. ",
  "ja542:46.3": "yadā te pahiṇeyyāmi ",
  "ja542:46.4": "tadā eyyāsi khattiya. ",
  "ja542:47.1": "tato ca pāyāsi pure mahosadho, ",
  "ja542:47.2": "pañcālarājassa puraṃ surammaṃ; ",
  "ja542:47.3": "nivesanāni māpetuṃ ",
  "ja542:47.4": "vedehassa yasassino. ",
  "ja542:48.1": "nivesanāni māpetvā ",
  "ja542:48.2": "vedehassa yasassino; ",
  "ja542:48.3": "athassa pahiṇī dūtaṃ ",
  "ja542:48.4": "(vedehaṃ mithilaggahaṃ) ",
  "ja542:48.5": "ehidāni mahārāja ",
  "ja542:48.6": "māpitaṃ te nivesanaṃ. ",
  "ja542:49.1": "tato ca rājā pāyāsi ",
  "ja542:49.2": "senāya caturaṅgiyā, ",
  "ja542:49.3": "anantavāhanaṃ daṭṭhuṃ ",
  "ja542:49.4": "phītaṃ kampilliyaṃ puraṃ. ",
  "ja542:50.1": "tato ca kho so gantvāna ",
  "ja542:50.2": "brahmadattassa pāhiṇī, ",
  "ja542:50.3": "āgatosmi mahārāja ",
  "ja542:50.4": "tava pādāni vandituṃ. ",
  "ja542:51.1": "dadāhidāni me bhariyaṃ ",
  "ja542:51.2": "nāriṃ sabbaṅgasobhiniṃ, ",
  "ja542:51.3": "suvaṇṇena paṭicchannaṃ ",
  "ja542:51.4": "dāsīgaṇapurakkhataṃ. ",
  "ja542:52.1": "svāgataṃ te vedeha ",
  "ja542:52.2": "atho te adurāgataṃ, ",
  "ja542:52.3": "nakkhattaññeva paripuccha ",
  "ja542:52.4": "ahaṃ kaññaṃ dadāmi te; ",
  "ja542:52.5": "suvaṇṇena paṭicchannaṃ ",
  "ja542:52.6": "dāsīgaṇapurakkhataṃ. ",
  "ja542:53.1": "tato ca rājā vedeho ",
  "ja542:53.2": "nakkhattaṃ paripucchatha, ",
  "ja542:53.3": "nakkhattaṃ paripucchitvā ",
  "ja542:53.4": "brahmadattassa pāhiṇī. ",
  "ja542:54.1": "dadāhidāni me bhariyaṃ ",
  "ja542:54.2": "nāriṃ sabbaṅgasobhiniṃ, ",
  "ja542:54.3": "suvaṇṇena paṭicchannaṃ ",
  "ja542:54.4": "dāsīgaṇapukkhataṃ. ",
  "ja542:55.1": "dadāmidāni me bhariyaṃ ",
  "ja542:55.2": "nāriṃ sabbaṅgasobhiniṃ, ",
  "ja542:55.3": "suvaṇṇena paṭicchannaṃ ",
  "ja542:55.4": "dāsīgaṇapurakkhataṃ. ",
  "ja542:56.1": "hatthi assā rathā pattī ",
  "ja542:56.2": "senā tiṭṭhanti vammitā, ",
  "ja542:56.3": "ukkā padittā jhāyanti ",
  "ja542:56.4": "kinnu maññanti paṇḍitā. ",
  "ja542:57.1": "hatthi assā rathā patti ",
  "ja542:57.2": "senā tiṭṭhanti vammitā, ",
  "ja542:57.3": "ukkā padittā jhāyanti ",
  "ja542:57.4": "kinnu kāhanti paṇḍitā. ",
  "ja542:58.1": "rakkhati taṃ mahārāja ",
  "ja542:58.2": "cūḷanīyo mahabbalo, ",
  "ja542:58.3": "paduṭṭho te brahmadatto ",
  "ja542:58.4": "pāto taṃ ghātayissati. ",
  "ja542:59.1": "ubbedhate me hadayaṃ ",
  "ja542:59.2": "mukhañca parisussati, ",
  "ja542:59.3": "nibbutiṃ nādhigacchāmi ",
  "ja542:59.4": "aggidaḍḍhova ātape. ",
  "ja542:60.1": "kammārānaṃ yathā ukkā ",
  "ja542:60.2": "anto jhāyati no bahi, ",
  "ja542:60.3": "evampi hadayaṃ mayhaṃ ",
  "ja542:60.4": "anto jhāyati no bahi. ",
  "ja542:61.1": "pamatto mantanātīto ",
  "ja542:61.2": "bhinnamantosi khattiya, ",
  "ja542:61.3": "idāni kho taṃ tāyantu ",
  "ja542:61.4": "paṇḍitā mantino janā. ",
  "ja542:62.1": "akatvāmaccassa vacanaṃ ",
  "ja542:62.2": "atthakāmahitesino, ",
  "ja542:62.3": "antapītirato rāja ",
  "ja542:62.4": "migo kūṭeva ohito. ",
  "ja542:63.1": "yathāpi maccho baḷisaṃ ",
  "ja542:63.2": "vaṅkaṃ maṃsena chāditaṃ, ",
  "ja542:63.3": "āmagiddho na jānāti ",
  "ja542:63.4": "maccho maraṇamattano. ",
  "ja542:64.1": "evameva tuvaṃ rāja ",
  "ja542:64.2": "cūḷaneyyassa dhītaraṃ, ",
  "ja542:64.3": "kāmagiddho na jānāsi ",
  "ja542:64.4": "macchova maraṇamattano. ",
  "ja542:65.1": "sace gacchasi pañcālaṃ ",
  "ja542:65.2": "khippamattaṃ jahessasi, ",
  "ja542:65.3": "migaṃ pathānupannaṃva ",
  "ja542:65.4": "mahantaṃ bhayamessati. ",
  "ja542:66.1": "anariyarūpo puriso janinda ",
  "ja542:66.2": "ahīva ucchaṅgagato ḍasayye, ",
  "ja542:66.3": "na tena mettiṃ kayirātha dhīro ",
  "ja542:66.4": "dukkho have kāpurisena saṅgamo. ",
  "ja542:67.1": "yantveva jaññā purisaṃ janinda ",
  "ja542:67.2": "sīlavāyaṃ bahussuto, ",
  "ja542:67.3": "teneva tettiṃ kayirātha dhīro ",
  "ja542:67.4": "sukho bhave sappurisena saṅgamo. ",
  "ja542:68.1": "bālo tuvaṃ phaḷamūgosi rāja ",
  "ja542:68.2": "yo uttamatthāni mayī lapittho, ",
  "ja542:68.3": "kimevāhaṃ naṅgalakoṭivaddho ",
  "ja542:68.4": "atthāni jānissaṃ yathāpi aññe. ",
  "ja542:69.1": "imaṃ gale gahetvāna ",
  "ja542:69.2": "nāsetha vijitā mama, ",
  "ja542:69.3": "yo me ratanalābhassa ",
  "ja542:69.4": "antarāyāya bhāsati. ",
  "ja542:70.1": "mahosadha atītena ",
  "ja542:70.2": "nānuvijjhanti paṇḍitā, ",
  "ja542:70.3": "ki maṃ assaṃ ca sambaddhaṃ ",
  "ja542:70.4": "patodeneva vijjhasi. ",
  "ja542:71.1": "sace passasi mokkhaṃ me ",
  "ja542:71.2": "khemaṃ vā pana passasi, ",
  "ja542:71.3": "teneva maṃ anusāsa ",
  "ja542:71.4": "kiṃ atītena vijjhasi. ",
  "ja542:72.1": "atītaṃ mānusaṃ kammaṃ ",
  "ja542:72.2": "dukkaraṃ durabhisambhavaṃ, ",
  "ja542:72.3": "na taṃ sakkomi mocetuṃ ",
  "ja542:72.4": "tvampi jānassu khattiya. ",
  "ja542:73.1": "santi vehāsayā nāgā ",
  "ja542:73.2": "iddhimanto yasassino, ",
  "ja542:73.3": "tepi ādāya gaccheyyuṃ ",
  "ja542:73.4": "yassa honti tathāvidhā. ",
