  "ja542:78.3": "yattha so labhate gādhaṃ ",
  "ja542:78.4": "tattha so vindate sukhaṃ. ",
  "ja542:79.1": "evaṃ ambhañca añño ca ",
  "ja542:79.2": "tvaṃ patiṭṭhā mahosadha, ",
  "ja542:79.3": "tvaṃ nosi mantinaṃ seṭṭho ",
  "ja542:79.4": "amhe dukkhā pamocaya. ",
