  "ja542:156.1": "sace maṃ vitanitvāna ",
  "ja542:156.2": "vedhayissasi sattiyā, ",
  "ja542:156.3": "evaṃ pañcālacaṇḍiyā ",
  "ja542:156.4": "vedeho vedhayissati. ",
  "ja542:157.1": "sace maṃ vitanitvāna ",
  "ja542:157.2": "vedhayissasi sattiyā, ",
  "ja542:157.3": "evaṃ nandāya deviyā ",
  "ja542:157.4": "vedeho vedhayissati. ",
  "ja542:158.1": "sace maṃ vitanitvāna ",
  "ja542:158.2": "vedhayissasi sattiyā, ",
  "ja542:158.3": "evaṃ te puttadārassa ",
  "ja542:158.4": "vedeho vedhayissati; ",
  "ja542:158.5": "evaṃ no mantitaṃ raho ",
  "ja542:158.6": "vedehena mayā sabha. ",
  "ja542:159.1": "yathā palasataṃ cammaṃ ",
  "ja542:159.2": "kontimantīsuniṭṭhitaṃ, ",
  "ja542:159.3": "upeti tanutāṇāya ",
  "ja542:159.4": "sarānaṃ paṭihantave. ",
  "ja542:160.1": "sukhāvaho dukkhanudo ",
  "ja542:160.2": "vedehassa yasassino, ",
  "ja542:160.3": "matiṃ te paṭihaññāmi ",
  "ja542:160.4": "usuṃ palasateniva. ",
  "ja542:161.1": "iṅgha passa mahārāja ",
  "ja542:161.2": "suññaṃ antepuraṃ tava, ",
  "ja542:161.3": "orodhā ca kumārā ca ",
  "ja542:161.4": "tava mātā ca khattiya ",
  "ja542:161.5": "ummaggā nīharitvāna ",
  "ja542:161.6": "vedehassupanāmitā. ",
  "ja542:162.1": "iṅgha antepuraṃ mayhaṃ ",
  "ja542:162.2": "gantvāna vicinātha naṃ, ",
  "ja542:162.3": "yathā imassa vacanaṃ ",
  "ja542:162.4": "saccaṃ vā yadi vā musā. ",
  "ja542:163.1": "evametaṃ mahārāja ",
  "ja542:163.2": "yathā āha mahosadho, ",
  "ja542:163.3": "suññaṃ antepuraṃ sabbaṃ ",
  "ja542:163.4": "kākapaṭṭanakaṃ yathā. ",
  "ja542:164.1": "ito gatā mahārāja ",
  "ja542:164.2": "nārī sabbaṅgasobhanā, ",
  "ja542:164.3": "kosumbhaphalakasussoṇī ",
  "ja542:164.4": "haṃsagaggarabhāṇinī. ",
  "ja542:165.1": "ito nītā mahārāja ",
  "ja542:165.2": "nārī sabbaṅgasobhanā, ",
  "ja542:165.3": "koseyyavasanā sāmā ",
  "ja542:165.4": "jātarūpasumekhalā. ",
  "ja542:166.1": "surattapādā kalyāṇī ",
  "ja542:166.2": "suvaṇṇamaṇimekhalā, ",
  "ja542:166.3": "pārevatakkhī sutanu ",
  "ja542:166.4": "bimboṭṭhā tanumajjhimā. ",
  "ja542:167.1": "sujātā bhujagalaṭṭhiva ",
  "ja542:167.2": "vellīva tanumajjhimā, ",
  "ja542:167.3": "dīghassā kesā asitā ",
  "ja542:167.4": "īsakaggapavellitā. ",
  "ja542:168.1": "sujātā migachāpīva ",
  "ja542:168.2": "hemantaggisikhāriva, ",
  "ja542:168.3": "nadīva giriduggesu ",
  "ja542:168.4": "sañchannā khuddaveḷuhi. ",
  "ja542:169.1": "nāganāsūru kalyāṇi ",
  "ja542:169.2": "paṭhamā timbarutthanī, ",
  "ja542:169.3": "nātidīghā nātirassā ",
  "ja542:169.4": "nālomā nātilomasā. ",
  "ja542:170.1": "nandāya nūna maraṇena ",
  "ja542:170.2": "nandasi sirivāhana, ",
  "ja542:170.3": "ahañca nūna nandā ca ",
  "ja542:170.4": "gacchāma yamasādhanaṃ. ",
  "ja542:171.1": "dibbaṃ adhīyase māyaṃ ",
  "ja542:171.2": "akāsi cakkhumohanaṃ, ",
  "ja542:171.3": "yo me amittaṃ hatthagataṃ ",
  "ja542:171.4": "vedehaṃ parimocayi. ",
  "ja542:172.1": "adhīyanti mahārāja ",
  "ja542:172.2": "dibbamāyidha paṇḍitā, ",
  "ja542:172.3": "te mocayanti attānaṃ ",
  "ja542:172.4": "paṇḍitā mantino janā. ",
  "ja542:173.1": "santi māṇavaputta ",
  "ja542:173.2": "kusalā sandhichedakā, ",
  "ja542:173.3": "yesaṃ katena maggena ",
  "ja542:173.4": "vedeho mithilaṃ gato. ",
  "ja542:174.1": "iṅgha passa mahārāja ",
  "ja542:174.2": "ummaggaṃ sādhu māpitaṃ, ",
  "ja542:174.3": "hatthīnaṃ atha assānaṃ ",
  "ja542:174.4": "rathānaṃ atha pattinaṃ. ",
  "ja542:174.5": "ālokabhūtaṃ tiṭṭhantaṃ ",
  "ja542:174.6": "ummaggaṃ sādhu niṭṭhitaṃ. ",
  "ja542:175.1": "lābhā vata videhānaṃ ",
  "ja542:175.2": "yassa me edisā paṇḍitā, ",
  "ja542:175.3": "ghare vasanti vijite ",
  "ja542:175.4": "yathā tvaṃsi mahosadha. ",
  "ja542:176.1": "vuttiñca parihārañca ",
  "ja542:176.2": "diguṇaṃ bhattavetanaṃ, ",
  "ja542:176.3": "dadāmi vipulaṃ bhogaṃ ",
  "ja542:176.4": "bhuñja kāme ramassu ca. ",
  "ja542:176.5": "mā videhaṃ paccagamā ",
  "ja542:176.6": "kiṃ videho karissati. ",
  "ja542:177.1": "yo cajetha mahārāja ",
  "ja542:177.2": "bhattāraṃ dhanakāraṇā, ",
  "ja542:177.3": "ubhinnaṃ hoti gārayho ",
  "ja542:177.4": "attano ca parassa ca; ",
  "ja542:177.5": "yāva jīveyya vedeho ",
  "ja542:177.6": "nāññassa puriso siyā. ",
  "ja542:178.1": "yo cajetha mahārāja ",
  "ja542:178.2": "bhattāraṃ dhanakāraṇā, ",
  "ja542:178.3": "ubhinnaṃ hoti gārayho ",
  "ja542:178.4": "attano ca parassa ca; ",
  "ja542:178.5": "yāva tiṭṭheyya vedeho ",
  "ja542:178.6": "nāññassa vijite vase. ",
  "ja542:179.1": "dammi nikkhasahassaṃ te ",
  "ja542:179.2": "gāmāsītiñca kāsisu, ",
  "ja542:179.3": "dāsīsatāni cattāri ",
  "ja542:179.4": "dammi bhariyāsatañca te; ",
  "ja542:179.5": "sabbaṃ senaṅgamādāya ",
  "ja542:179.6": "sotthiṃ gaccha mahosadha. ",
  "ja542:180.1": "yācaṃ dadantu hatthīnaṃ ",
  "ja542:180.2": "assānaṃ dviguṇaṃ vidhaṃ, ",
  "ja542:180.3": "tappentu annapānena ",
  "ja542:180.4": "rathike pattikārake. ",
  "ja542:181.1": "hatthi asse rathe patti ",
  "ja542:181.2": "gacchevādāya paṇḍita, ",
  "ja542:181.3": "passatu taṃ mahārājā ",
  "ja542:181.4": "vedeho mithilaṃ gataṃ. ",
  "ja542:182.1": "hatthi assā rathā patti ",
  "ja542:182.2": "senā padissate mahā, ",
  "ja542:182.3": "caturaṅginī bhiṃsarūpā ",
  "ja542:182.4": "kinnu maññanti paṇḍitā. ",
  "ja542:183.1": "ānando te mahārāja ",
  "ja542:183.2": "uttamo patidissati, ",
  "ja542:183.3": "sabbaṃ senaṅgamādāya ",
  "ja542:183.4": "sotthiṃ patto mahosadho. ",
  "ja542:184.1": "yathā petaṃ susānasmiṃ ",
  "ja542:184.2": "chaḍḍetvā caturo janā, ",
  "ja542:184.3": "evaṃ kampilliye tyamhā ",
  "ja542:184.4": "chaḍḍayitvā idhāgatā. ",
  "ja542:185.1": "atha tvaṃ kena vaṇṇena ",
  "ja542:185.2": "kena vā pana hetunā, ",
  "ja542:185.3": "kena vā atthajātena ",
  "ja542:185.4": "attānaṃ parimocayi. ",
  "ja542:186.1": "atthaṃ atthena vedeha ",
  "ja542:186.2": "mantaṃ mantena khattiya, ",
  "ja542:186.3": "parivārayissaṃ rājānaṃ ",
  "ja542:186.4": "jambudīpaṃva sāgaro. ",
  "ja542:187.1": "dinnaṃ nikkhasahassaṃ me ",
  "ja542:187.2": "gāmāsīti ca kāsisu, ",
  "ja542:187.3": "dāsīsatāni cattāri ",
  "ja542:187.4": "dinnaṃ bhariyāsatañca me ",
  "ja542:187.5": "sabbaṃ senaṅgamādāya ",
  "ja542:187.6": "sotthinambhi idhāgato. ",
  "ja542:188.1": "susukhaṃ vata saṃvāso ",
  "ja542:188.2": "paṇḍitehīti senaka, ",
  "ja542:188.3": "pakkhīva pañjare baddhe ",
  "ja542:188.4": "macche jālagateriva; ",
  "ja542:188.5": "amittahatthatthagate ",
  "ja542:188.6": "mocayī no mahosadho. ",
  "ja542:189.1": "evametaṃ mahārāja ",
  "ja542:189.2": "paṇḍitā hi sukhāvahā, ",
  "ja542:189.3": "pakkhīva pañjare baddhe ",
  "ja542:189.4": "macche jālagateriva; ",
  "ja542:189.5": "amittahatthatthagate ",
  "ja542:189.6": "mocayī no mahosadho. ",
  "ja542:190.1": "āhaññantu sabbavīṇā ",
  "ja542:190.2": "bheriyo deṇḍimāni ca, ",
  "ja542:190.3": "nadantu māgadhā saṅkhā ",
  "ja542:190.4": "vaggu vadatu dundubhi. ",
  "ja542:191.1": "orodhā ca kumārā ca ",
  "ja542:191.2": "vesiyānā ca brāhmaṇā, ",
  "ja542:191.3": "bahuṃ annaṃ ca pānañca ",
  "ja542:191.4": "paṇḍitassābhihārayuṃ. ",
  "ja542:192.1": "hatthārūhā anīkaṭṭhā ",
  "ja542:192.2": "rathikā pattikārakā, ",
  "ja542:192.3": "bahuṃ annañca pānañca ",
  "ja542:192.4": "paṇḍitassābhihārayuṃ. ",
  "ja542:193.1": "samāgatā jānapadā ",
  "ja542:193.2": "negamā ca samāgatā, ",
  "ja542:193.3": "bahuṃ annañca pānañca ",
  "ja542:193.4": "paṇḍitassābhihārayuṃ. ",
  "ja542:194.1": "bahujjano pasannosi ",
  "ja542:194.2": "disvā paṇḍitamāgate, ",
  "ja542:194.3": "paṇḍitamhi anuppatte ",
  "ja542:194.4": "celukkhepo avattathāti. ",
  "ja542:195.1": "mahāummaggakaṇḍaṃ. sace vo vuyhamānānaṃ sattannaṃ udakaṇṇave, manussabalimesāno nāmaṃ gaṇheyya rakkhaso; anupubbaṃ kathaṃ datvā muñcesi dakarakkhino. mātaraṃ paṭhamaṃ dajjaṃ bhariyaṃ datvāna bhātaraṃ, tato sahāyaṃ datvāna pañcamaṃ dajjaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ; chaṭṭhāhaṃ dajjamattānaṃ neva dajjaṃ mahosadhaṃ. posetā te janettī ca digharattānukampikā, chambhī tayi paduṭṭhasmiṃ paṇḍitā atthadassinī; aññaṃ upanisaṃ katvā vadhā taṃ parimocayi. taṃ tādisaṃ pāṇadadiṃ orasaṃ gabbhadhāriṇiṃ, mātaraṃ kena dosena dajjāsi dakarakkhino. daharāviya alaṅkārā dhāreti apiḷandhanaṃ dovārike anīkaṭṭhe ativelaṃ pajagghati. tatopi paṭirājānaṃ sayaṃ dūtāni sāsati, mātaraṃ tena dosena dajjāhaṃ dakarakkhino. itthigumbassa pavarā accantapiyavādini, anuggatā sīlavatī chāyāva anapāyinī. akkodhanā paññavatī paṇḍitā atthadassinī, ubbariṃ kena dosena dajjāsi dakarakkhino. khiḍḍhāratisamāpannaṃ anatthavasamāgataṃ, sā maṃ sakānaṃ puttānaṃ ayācaṃ yācate dhanaṃ, sohaṃ dadāmi sāratto bahuṃ uccāvacaṃ dhanaṃ. suduccajaṃ cajitvāna pacchā socāmi dummano; ubbariṃ tena dosena dajjāmi dakarakkhino. yenāvitā jānapadā ānītā ca paṭiggahaṃ, ābhataṃ pararajjehi abhiṭṭhāya bahuṃ dhanaṃ. dhanuggahānaṃ pavaraṃ sūraṃ tikhiṇamantinaṃ, bhātaraṃ kena dosena dajjāsi dakarakkhino. mayocitā jānapadā ānītā ca paṭiggahaṃ, ābhataṃ pararajjehi abhiṭṭhāya bahuṃ dhanaṃ. dhanuggahānaṃ pavaro sūro tikhiṇamanti ca, mayāyaṃ sukhito rājā atimaññati dārako. upaṭṭhānampi me ayye na so eti yathā pure, bhātaraṃ tena dosena dajjāhaṃ dakarakkhino. ekarattena ubhayo tuvaṃ ca dhanusekhavā, ubho jātettha pañcālā pahāyā susamāvayā. cariyā taṃ anubandhittho ekadukkhasukho tava, ussukko te divārattiṃ sabbakiccesu vyāvaṭo; sahāyaṃ kena dosena dajjāsi dakarakkhino. cariyāya ayaṃ ayye pajagghittho mayā saha, ajjāpi tena vaṇṇena ativelaṃ pajagghati. ubbariyāpi me ayye mantayāmi rahogato, anāmantā pavisati pubbe appaṭivedito. laddhavāro katokāso ahirikaṃ anādaraṃ, sahāyaṃ tena dosena dajjāhaṃ dakarakkhino. kusalo sabbanimittānaṃ rudaññū āgatāgamo, uppāde supine yutto niyyāṇe ca pavesane. paddho bhummantalikkhasmiṃ nakkhattapadakovido, brāhmaṇaṃ kena dosena dajjāsi dakarakkhino. parisāyampi me ayye mīlayitvā udikkhati, tasmā ajja bhamuṃ luddaṃ dajjāhaṃ dakarakkhino. sasamuddapariyāyaṃ mahiṃ sāgarakuṇḍalaṃ, vasundharaṃ āvasasi amaccaparivārito. cāturanto mahāraṭṭho vijitāvī mahabbalo, pathavyā ekarājāsi yaso te vipulaṃgato. soḷasitthisahassāni āmuttamaṇikuṇḍalā, nānājanapadā nariyo devakaññūpamā subhā. evaṃ sabbaṅgasampannaṃ sabbakāmasamiddhinaṃ, sukhitānaṃ piyaṃ dīghaṃ jīvitaṃ āhu khattiya. atha tvaṃ kena vaṇṇena kena vā pana hetunā, paṇḍitaṃ anurakkhanto pāṇaṃ cajasi duccajaṃ. yatopi āgato ayye mama hatthaṃ mahosadho, nābhijānāmi dhīrassa anumattampi dukkataṃ. sace ca kismici kāle maraṇaṃ me pure siyā, putte ca me paputte ca sukhāpeyya mahosadho. anāgataṃ paccuppannaṃ sabbamatthaṃ vipassati, anāparādhakammantaṃ na dajjaṃ dakarakkhino. idaṃ suṇotha pañcālā cūḷanīyassa bhāsitaṃ, paṇḍitaṃ anurakkhanto pāṇaṃ cajati duccajaṃ. mātu bhariyāya bhātucca sakhino brāhmaṇassa ca, attano cāpi pañcālo channaṃ cajati jīvitaṃ. evaṃ mahatthikā paññā nipuṇā sādhucintanī, diṭṭhadhamme hitatthāya samparāye sukhāya ca. dakarakkhasapañho. bheri uppalavaṇṇāsi pitā suddhodano ahu, mātā āsi mahāmāyā amarā bimmasundarī. suvo ahosi ānando sāriputtosi cūḷanī, mahosadho lokanātho evaṃ dhāretha jātakaṃ. mahāummaggajātakaṃ navamaṃ. "
}
